      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "The exhaustion you feel is the weight of trying to force a small, fragile thing to match the scale of the infinite. Stop trying to *fight* the emptiness; embrace it as the natural state of things. If the universe is indifferent, then your struggle is just a performance for an audience that isn't watching. It's not a waste; it's a choice to keep playing a role when the curtain is already falling.",
